{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168480/extras/27ff3b0b507e1f68ac096c27afd1aef2.avif?t=1765416903\" alt=\"renting in a HELLSCAPE of GREED, CONSUMERISM &amp; BODILY INVASION\" width=1200 height=155 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the wits to escape Janet\u2019s WICKED plans for you? It\u2019s the renter\u2019s nightmare - a SURPRISE INSPECTION! You have no choice but to do as you\u2019re told and CLEAN.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voice acted\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set camera angles inspired by classic survival-horror games</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168480/extras/d6852d17b4f634291dbbfdb026df8cfb.avif?t=1765416903\" alt=\"solve VILE puzzles\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a maze of DEPRAVED magical appliances and the UNHINGED diaries of a DEBAUCHED faded television celebrity. Pray you can escape with what\u2019s left of your SANITY.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If\u00a0<i>Resident Evil</i>\u00a0expanded into full puzzle rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat but plenty of mould-spraying</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~5 hours play time\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168480/extras/b668adfa506c9e5c501f7e438fc2b123.avif?t=1765416903\" alt=\"save your FRIENDS\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s something WRONG with your housemates. They are ranting and obsessing, and your itchy skin is turning as crumpled as Janet\u2019s paper crafts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to uncover WHAT she is doing in the house, HOW she is MANIPULATING you, and discover WHY she\u2019s so \u2026 so\u2026 TALENTED. \u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re so glad she\u2019s your landlord!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re so PROUD to have increased her revenue by 48.7% in the last financial quarter and you really don\u2019t want anyone to miss out on this -</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FANTASTIC ONCE IN A LIFETIME OPPORTUNITY</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the INNER REALTY family by investing in Janet\u2019s Lakehousing\u2122 Project</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come down to our showroom NOW!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168480/extras/508aed75dbb5573ef9009a3004d50286.avif?t=1765416903\" alt=\"moodboard\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Tone</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80s classics\u00a0<i>Beetlejuice</i>\u00a0and\u00a0<i>Poltergeist</i>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >via\u00a0<i>The Real Housewives of Sydney</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Look</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop-motion horror of Henry Selick (<i>Nightmare Before Christmas</i>,\u00a0<i>Coraline</i>)\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Junji Ito if he got into paper mache</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Less Scares Mode</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disables horror content that isn\u2019t central to the story for a more relaxed experience</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag